        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9039P, Hexagon Back-To-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you want the same pull on both sides of your door, this Hexagon Back-To-Back Door Pull Set is an excellent--and modern--choice. These Hex Back-to-Back Pulls comes packaged with 2 door pulls and the back-to-back mounting hardware. Choose from 12 inch or 18 inch lengths. The Omnia Hexagon Pull Set is available in a wide array of modern finish colors. Its unique hexagon shape will be sure to turn heads and make people notice. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Hexagon Pull Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-9039P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-9039P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9039P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/hex-door-pull-omnia-9039p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
